      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POKE SALAD ANNIE (3) took the sit on the lead from a low draw but levelled up and led around the bend to score (17.43) at this track in a Grade 5 over 305m. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. DIMORA BERNIE (2) flew the lids with a fast early split last time, hitting the frame with a 6 length third (23.24) over 400m at this track and making it two placings on end. Expecting another good run. BELAIR BLUE (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing sixth (22.86) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Worth following up. CANYA NAMELESS (6) ran an exceptional 22.03 win last time. Not to be underestimated.",
